<!-- 出工日志 · 快捷报销（与网页端同页分区：批量下载 + 工作任务单 / 费用汇总 / 派车汇总，全部直接可见） -->
<navbar back title="快捷报销" />

<view class="page-body qb-page">
  <!-- 共用日期范围 -->
  <view class="card qb-date-card">
    <view class="qb-date-l">
      <view class="qb-date-t">报销范围</view>
      <view class="qb-date-s">以下分区共用同一日期范围；单次最多 31 天。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="qb-range">
      <text class="qb-range-text">{{from}} ~ {{to}}</text>
      <view class="qb-change" hover-class="hover-opacity" bindtap="onOpenRange">改日期</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 批量下载 -->
  <view class="card qb-sec">
    <view class="qb-sec-h">
      <view>
        <view class="qb-sec-t">批量下载</view>
        <view class="qb-sec-s">按月分组勾选水印照片，支持组合 PDF / PDF 存网盘 / 下载选中。</view>
      </view>
      <view class="qb-sec-meta">{{photoTotal}} 张</view>
    </view>

    <view class="qb-photo-body">
      <view wx:if="{{photoLoading}}" class="qb-empty">正在加载照片…</view>
      <view wx:elif="{{!photoTotal}}" class="qb-empty">该范围暂无水印照片</view>
      <block wx:else>
        <view class="qb-month" wx:for="{{photoGroups}}" wx:for-item="g" wx:for-index="gi" wx:key="month">
          <view class="qb-month-t">{{g.title}}</view>
          <view class="qb-grid">
            <view class="qb-photo" wx:for="{{g.photos}}" wx:for-item="p" wx:for-index="pi" wx:key="id">
              <image class="qb-thumb" src="{{p.url}}" mode="aspectFill" bindtap="onPreviewPhoto" data-url="{{p.url}}" />
              <view class="qb-day">{{p.day}}日</view>
              <view
                class="qb-ring {{p.selected ? 'on' : ''}}"
                catchtap="onPhotoToggle"
                data-gi="{{gi}}"
                data-pi="{{pi}}"
              >
                <t-icon wx:if="{{p.selected}}" name="check" t-class="ico-22" />
              </view>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </block>
    </view>

    <view class="qb-pdf-row">
      <view class="qb-line-btn {{pdfBusy ? 'disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onPdf">
        <t-icon name="file-pdf" t-class="ico-30 ico-brand" />下载为 PDF
      </view>
      <view class="qb-line-btn {{pdfBusy ? 'disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onPdfSave">
        <t-icon name="folder-import" t-class="ico-30 ico-brand" />PDF 存网盘
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="qb-dl-foot">
      <view class="qb-all" hover-class="hover-opacity" bindtap="onPhotoToggleAll">
        <view class="qb-ring qb-ring-static {{photoAll ? 'on' : ''}}">
          <t-icon wx:if="{{photoAll}}" name="check" t-class="ico-22" />
        </view>
        <text>全选</text>
        <text class="qb-count">已选 {{photoSelected}} 张</text>
      </view>
      <view
        class="qb-dl-btn {{photoSelected === 0 ? 'disabled' : ''}}"
        hover-class="{{photoSelected === 0 ? '' : 'hover-opacity'}}"
        bindtap="onDownloadPhotos"
        >下 载</view
      >
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 三张汇总表：仅超管 / 班组管理员 -->
  <block wx:if="{{isAdmin}}">
    <view class="card qb-sec" wx:for="{{sheetSections}}" wx:key="kind">
      <view class="qb-sheet-t">{{item.title}}</view>
      <view class="qb-sheet-s">{{item.desc}}</view>
      <view class="qb-sheet-ops">
        <view
          class="qb-gen {{sheetBusyKind ? 'disabled' : ''}}"
          hover-class="hover-opacity"
          bindtap="onSheetGenerate"
          data-kind="{{item.kind}}"
          >{{sheetBusyKind === item.kind ? '正在生成…' : '生成并打开'}}</view
        >
        <view
          class="qb-save {{sheetSavingKind ? 'disabled' : ''}}"
          hover-class="hover-opacity"
          bindtap="onSheetSave"
          data-kind="{{item.kind}}"
          >{{sheetSavingKind === item.kind ? '正在保存…' : '存网盘'}}</view
        >
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view class="qb-note">汇总表三区仅超管 / 本班班组管理员可用；生成前如存在未通过核验，会先提示处理。</view>
</view>

<!-- 共用日期范围日历 -->
<t-calendar
  visible="{{calVisible}}"
  value="{{calValue}}"
  type="range"
  allow-same-day
  switch-mode="month"
  min-date="{{minDate}}"
  max-date="{{maxDate}}"
  title="选择日期范围"
  confirm-btn="确定选择"
  bind:confirm="onCalConfirm"
  bind:close="onCalClose"
/>

<!-- PDF / 汇总共用网盘目录选择 -->
<nd-dirpicker
  visible="{{ndSaveVisible}}"
  default-path="出工日志"
  bind:confirm="onNdDirConfirm"
  bind:close="onNdDirClose"
/>

<t-toast id="t-toast" />
